d-hint-wrapper ng-tns-c2842056177-25 ng-trigger ng-trigger-transitionMessages ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"mat-form-field-hint-spacer ng-tns-c2842056177-25\"></div></div><!----></div></div></mat-form-field></form><!----><!----></app-jss-airport-combobox><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></form></section><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-booking-trip><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div></app-jss-saudia-general-tab><!----></sc-render-component>\n            </div>\n          <!----></div></mat-tab-body><!----></div></mat-tab-group><sc-placeholder name=\"jssAncillaryLinks\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder><sc-placeholder name=\"jssNotificationInfo\"><!----><app-jss-notification-info class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div tabindex=\"0\" class=\"covid-update-box d-justify-bw ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"title\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">info</span><p class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Read more about the latest travel requirements for your next destination</p><!----></div><a href=\"/en-SA/plan/before-you-fly/travel-requirements\" class=\"learnlink ng-star-inserted\" linktype=\"internal\" id=\"{39213815-B9BE-43B2-8ABD-6CA04500BEBF}\" target=\"_self\" aria-label=\"Learn more about covid restrictions\"><span role=\"button\" class=\"notification__text ng-star-inserted\">Learn more </span><!----><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined more arrow\"> chevron_right </span><!----></a><!----></div><!----></app-jss-notification-info><!----></sc-placeholder><div tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" class=\"custom-overlay-close ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"material-icons icon-close-outlined close\">close</span></div><!----></div></div><!----></app-jss-saudia-general-tablayout><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"custom-content__wrapper\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<h2>Mauritius</h2>\n<h3>A tropical paradise where nature and culture blend seamlessly</h3>\n<p>\nMauritius, an island of breathtaking landscapes and diverse culture, invites you to experience the essence of paradise. Discover this gem in the Indian Ocean, where beauty and adventure await at every turn.\nMauritius enjoys a warm, humid summer from November to April, perfect for beach relaxation and island exploration.\n</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<img src=\"-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Live-images/Destinations/fly-saudia-to-mauritius-2-01012025.ashx?rev=837150ca4ee34ac1a03c5c64e9f35647&amp;hash=F5F121EAB70F7869E454BE873AD38AAD\" alt=\"Scenic view of Mauritius\">\n<h3>Explore Mauritius’s natural wonders and cultural landmarks</h3>\n<p>\nStart your adventure at Black River Gorges National Park, a lush haven for hikers and wildlife enthusiasts alike. Visit the iconic Sir Seewoosagur Ramgoolam Botanical Garden, famed for its giant water lilies and tropical plants. Chamarel Seven Colored Earth Geopark offers a unique landscape of colorful sand dunes, a must-see natural wonder.\nDiscover the history of sugar at L’Aventure du Sucre museum, or unwind at the beautiful Le Morne Public Beach. For wildlife encounters, La Vanille Nature Park and Casela Nature Parks offer unforgettable experiences with native animals. Don’t miss Île aux Cerfs, a stunning island known for its crystal-clear waters and vibrant marine life.\n</p>\n<h3>Mauritian cuisine is a blend of Indian, Chinese, Creole, and French influences</h3>\n<p>\nTry boulettes, steamed dumplings enjoyed as street food, or dholl puri, a flatbread filled with spiced yellow split peas. Savor the unique taste of fish vindaye, a tangy pickled fish dish. Bol renversé, a stir-fry dish served over rice, is another favorite that’s both filling and flavorful. For a sweet treat, enjoy poudine maïs, a corn pudding, or napolitaine, a shortbread cookie with jam.\n</p>\n<h3>Mauritius: Where every moment is a piece of paradise</h3>\n<h3><span>Plan your trip now!</span></h3>\n</div>\n</div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-image-link-list class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"custom-carousel imagelinklist--content-embedded h--left v--center image--teaser mobile-text--center ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div appswiper=\"\" fxflex=\"auto\" class=\"swiper-container ng-star-inserted swiper-initialized swiper-horizontal swiper-backface-hidden\"><div class=\"swiper-wrapper\"><div class=\"swiper-slide ng-star-inserted swiper-slide-active\"><div fxlayout=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"\" fxflexfill=\"\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"swiper-slide__image desktop-view ng-star-inserted\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" alt=\"visit saudi\" width=\"1200\" height=\"372\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Live-images/Campaign-Banner/2025/05/sta-calendar-en.ashx?h=372&amp;iar=0&amp;w=1200&amp;rev=01cefa3ed2424beebbeb55f4550b662e&amp;hash=3149C512C2EBA61FE7EF6A713229FD95\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"image-gradient\" id=\"9eb3fa48-d83c-4da1-b74d-43f83d529920\"></div></div><!----><!----><div class=\"con